abstract: >-
  Research software that applies transparent rule-based heuristic indicators
  (H1 pragmatic-function patterns, H2 historical vs metaphorical/anachronistic
  cues, H3 surface density/vacuity markers, and informal-fallacy lexical
  pattern flags) to Spanish party tweets containing documented ideology-related
  substrings. Outputs are operational pattern labels, not independently
  validated determinations of rhetorical fallacies, discursive anachronisms,
  or semantic vacuity. Raw tweet corpora are not redistributed.
